KEY FINDING (MTP):
  config has num_mtp_layers=1 AND num_nextn_predict_layers=1, but the NATIVE transformers
  deepseek_v3 impl builds 0 MTP/nextn modules (model.named_modules() has none). So introspect
  discovers nothing -> C15 would vacuously PASS. The model author's remote code builds MTP but
  breaks on transformers 5.x (is_torch_fx_available), and we prefer native impl.
  USER DECISION: accept native limitation, surface via C15 WARN (don't chase remote-code MTP).
  Applies to Phase 9 (DeepSeek-V3) and reserved DeepSeek-V4 too.

